 ## [Unreleased]
+
+- **Generate documentation from a declaration.** The Generate PHPDoc block action proposes documentation using the declaration’s types, inherited generic information and uncaught exceptions, while preserving existing comments and attributes. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Config and translation keys follow imported aliases and named arguments.** Completion and navigation identify the actual helper or facade; local names keep their own meaning and config value types survive aliased calls. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
